{"path":"experimental/basic_string_view/operator_at","title":"std::experimental::basic_string_view<CharT,Traits>::operator[]","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::experimental::basic_string_view&lt;CharT,Traits&gt;::</span>operator[]","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/experimental/basic_string_view/operator_at","section":"experimental","kind":"page","summary":"Returns a const reference to the character at specified location pos.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-libfund_ts\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> const_reference operator<span class=\"br0\">[</span><span class=\"br0\">]</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>size_type pos<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-libfund-ts t-mark-ts\">(library fundamentals TS)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Returns a const reference to the character at specified location <code>pos</code>.\n</p><p>No bounds checking is performed: the behavior is undefined if <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">pos <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;=</span> size<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>. \n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td>  pos\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td>  position of the character to return\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>Const reference to the requested character\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Exceptions\">Exceptions</h3>\n<p>Does not throw\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Complexity\">Complexity</h3>\n<p>Constant.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Notes\">Notes</h3>\n<p>Unlike <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/string/basic_string/operator_at\">std::basic_string::operator[]</a></span>, <code>basic_string_